# The following CVEs affect OS-level packages in the python:3.12-slim
# (Debian 13.5) base image. No fixed version is available from Debian
# as of the build date. These are base image vulnerabilities outside
# the application's control and are documented here per the assignment
# requirement to "document any whitelisted CVEs".

# ncurses - Buffer overflow (no fix available in Debian 13.5)
CVE-2025-69720

# perl-base - Path traversal via crafted symlinks (no fix available)
CVE-2026-42496

# perl-base - Heap buffer overflow (no fix available)
CVE-2026-8376

# perl-base - Archive::Tar hardlink attack (no fix available)
CVE-2026-42497

# perl-base - IO-Compress arbitrary code execution (no fix available)
CVE-2026-48962

# perl-base - Archive::Tar memory exhaustion (no fix available)
CVE-2026-9538